# ==============================================================================
# STARFRONT WORLD V2 — RUNTIME ASSET CONFIGURATION (OPTIONAL)
# ==============================================================================
# All public asset delivery parameters have verified source defaults embedded:
# - Baseline CDN: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/viettanpham/starfront-assets@v2.0-assets-r1/starfront-world-assets
# - Default Storage Mode: jsdelivr
#
# Only uncomment and configure if deploying a custom CDN mirror or local storage:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSET_CDN_URL=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/viettanpham/starfront-assets@v2.0-assets-r1/starfront-world-assets
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSET_STORAGE_MODE=jsdelivr

# ==============================================================================
# STARFRONT WORLD V2 — ADMINCP AUTHENTICATION (SERVER-ONLY, NEVER COMMIT VALUES)
# ==============================================================================
# In development, define in local uncommitted .env.local (already gitignored).
# In production (Cloud Run), inject via Google Cloud Secret Manager.
# Do NOT prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# NOTE: If password contains special characters (e.g. #, $, !), wrap in double quotes ("").
#
# STARFRONT_ADMIN_PRIMARY_PASSWORD="your_primary_admin_password_here"
# STARFRONT_ADMIN_BACKUP_PASSWORD="your_backup_admin_password_here"
# ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET="your_32_or_64_character_cryptographic_session_secret"
# STARFRONT_ADMIN_SYNC_SECRETS="true"

# ==============================================================================
# STARFRONT WORLD V2 — PRODUCTION GCS PERSISTENCE (OPTIONAL)
# ==============================================================================
# Only required if persisting Story Markdown & manifests directly to Google Cloud Storage.
# If omitted or uncredentialed, system automatically uses local atomic CAS persistence.
#
# GCS_STORY_BUCKET_NAME=your-starfront-story-bucket
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/path/to/service-account-key.json